Shiguang Transfer 0.2.0-alpha
Copyright 2026 Shiguang Transfer contributors
Derived from user-provided LumaLink progressive.3 source, based on Angelnable/LumaLink.
Modified 2026-10-30: original photo-first interface, encrypted saved camera profiles,
foreground reconnect, same-session scan resume, preview scheduling and download diagnostics.
See docs/CHANGES_SHIGUANG_0.2.0.md. Apache License 2.0 applies.
Independently maintained; not endorsed by Panasonic or LumaLink authors.

Shiguang Transfer 0.2.1-alpha (2026-10-30): preserve SOAP fault 701, bounded playback recovery, normal-window metadata/grant refresh and regression tests. Apache-2.0.

Shiguang 0.2.2 (2026-10-30): on-demand original previews, shared preview cache, safe-area preview page and zoom.
Shiguang 0.2.3 (2026-10-30): preserve advertised large-preview resources and automatically enhance JPEG previews while retaining quick RAW previews.
Shiguang 0.2.4 (2026-10-30): reactive preview authorization, small grant renewal with SOAP 701 fallback, conditional playback settling and request-order regression tests.
Shiguang 0.2.5 (2026-10-30): cancellation disconnects blocking preview connections; bounded preview inactivity timeouts and stage diagnostics.
0.2.5 log-driven addition: bounded foreground getstate heartbeats serialized with camera access, with no automatic access or mode changes.
Shiguang 0.2.6 (2026-10-30): application-owned camera scan, foreground scan protection/locks, back navigation/title refinement, object-page progress and resource-identity fixes.
Shiguang 0.2.7 (2026-10-30): filtered swipe-preview queues, daily import history, explicit record/phone-file deletion and standard Android LUMIX Lab handoff with manual fallback.
Shiguang 0.2.8 (2026-10-30): gesture-driven animated preview paging, capture-day labels/filtering, camera timestamp normalization and explicit Lab editor-route probing.
Shiguang 0.2.9 (2026-10-30): local completed-import badges with conservative resource identity and background history indexing, without added camera requests.
Shiguang 0.2.10 (2026-10-30): bounded local thumbnails for completed import records, with cancellation and unsupported-format placeholders.
